<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Monday it had cut its rating for Mexican cement company Cemex SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are downgrading Cemex to hold from buy based on our market expectations and the company's high multiple valuation relative to its international peers,&quot; analyst Rafael Elias-Linero wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- Cemex's shares closed at 32 pesos on Friday in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
